.TH POHODA-DAYDIGEST 1 "May 2026" "pohoda-digest" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pohoda-daydigest \- generate daily Pohoda accounting digest
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pohoda-daydigest
[\fIENVFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generates a daily digest report from Pohoda accounting data covering today.
Output format is controlled by the OUTPUT_FORMAT environment variable (md, html, pdf).
Results can be saved to file (DIGEST_SAVETO) and/or emailed (DIGEST_MAILTO).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I ENVFILE
Optional path to .env configuration file (default: .env in project root).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B POHODA_URL
Pohoda mServer URL.
.TP
.B POHODA_USERNAME
mServer username.
.TP
.B POHODA_PASSWORD
mServer password.
.TP
.B POHODA_ICO
Company identification number.
.TP
.B OUTPUT_FORMAT
Output format: md (Markdown), html, pdf (default: html).
.TP
.B DIGEST_SAVETO
Path to save the generated digest file.
.TP
.B DIGEST_MAILTO
Email address to send the digest to.
.TP
.B MAIL_DSN
Symfony Mailer DSN for email transport.
.TP
.B THEME
CSS theme for HTML/PDF output (default: bootstrap).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pohoda-daydigest (1),
.BR pohoda-weekdigest (1),
.BR pohoda-monthdigest (1),
.BR pohoda-yeardigest (1),
.BR pohoda-alltimedigest (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>
